{"overview":"تریانا وگا، بازیگر درگیر مشکلات، به‌عنوان معلم جایگزین بدون صلاحیت به مدرسهٔ سابقش، هالیوود آرتس، بازمی‌گردد و به‌سرعت خود را میان درگیری‌ها و الهام‌بخشی‌های ناخواسته به نسل جدیدی از دانش‌آموزان پرآرزوی و بااستعداد می‌یابد که در مدرسهٔ برتر هنرهای نمایشی هالیوود مسیر واقعی خود را می‌جست‌وجو می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Struggling actress Trina Vega returns to her former high school, Hollywood Arts, as an unqualified substitute teacher, quickly finding herself both clashing with and unexpectedly inspiring a new generation of ambitious and talented students as they learn to find their true path at Hollywood's most elite performing arts school.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":26,"y":2026,"poster":"/4LGxlmu6TkyrqR9PuNAUL042Zfz.jpg"}],"episodes":26,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"دانیلا مونت","role":"Trina Vega","photo":"/5QW1c5SUch81C5KIpfJgclJ4ct5.jpg","en":"Daniella Monet"},{"name":"Alyssa Miles","role":"Emmy Ward","photo":"/d9hDngdVwXhAQv9zMMttG3Md2Gx.jpg"},{"name":"Emmy Liu-Wang","role":"Pepper","photo":"/2tGqKiwu42XhnUsZDBPXo8LI5l5.jpg"},{"name":"Peyton Jackson","role":"Qwest","photo":"/lS1aBK2F2uTnM7HqejSQsCnYWBo.jpg"},{"name":"Erika Swayze","role":"Jen Z","photo":"/phn3vAg06wA9aJHPVqJ7mbEMGn2.jpg"},{"name":"Martin Kamm","role":"Oscar Ward","photo":"/dfdvSfPZpSobEEtTUZK9Pu2nylM.jpg"}],"trailer":"IXQP43JjY4Q","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/286183-hollywood-arts/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/286183-hollywood-arts/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://ww